    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi en olamdog kede jo Levi ame rik odwogo iyi opii i Babulon karacel kede Jerubabel wot a Cealtiel, kede alamdog adwoŋ Yecua. Gin ene: Ceraya, Jeremia, Ejira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaria, Malluk, Kattuc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cekania, Rekum, Meremot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iddo, Ginnetoi, Abija, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mijamin, Madia, Bilga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cemaya, Joyarib, Jedaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Callu, Amok, Kilkia, kede Jedaya. Magi en ame rik obedo olamdog ame loo owotegi i kare adwoŋi Yecua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Levi ene: Jo me agege-ni obedo jo ame rik loo tic me telo wer me pwoyo Obaŋa i ot Obaŋa, Yecua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Cerebia, Juda, kede Mattania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Bakbukia, Unno kede owotegi te cuŋ tikere kedgi i ot woro Obaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecua rik obedo papa a Joyakim, Joyakim te nywalo Eliacib, Eliacib te nywalo Joyada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyada te nywalo Yonacan, eka Yonacan te nywalo Jaddua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ame Joyakim rik onwoŋo tye acalo alamdog adwoŋ, jo magi en ame onwoŋo tye acalo odoŋe ame loo doggolagi i kom olamdog, Meraya, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Ceraya, Kanania, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Jeremia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mecullam, ame onwoŋo loo doggola Ejira, Jekokanan, ame onwoŋo loo doggola Amaria; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonacan, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Malluki, Yucepu, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Cebania; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adna, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Karim, Kelkai, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Merayot; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jekaria, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Iddo, Mecullam, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Ginneton; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jikri, ame onwoŋo loo doggola Miniamin, Piltao ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Moadia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cammua, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Bilga, Yekonacan, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Cemaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mattenai, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Joyarib, Uji, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Jedaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kallai, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Callai Eber, ame onwoŋo loo doggola Amok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kacabia ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Kilkia, kede Netanel, ame onwoŋo loo doggola a Jedaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo me doggola a jo Levi kede me doggola olamdog adoŋo rik obedo coyo piny i kare ame olamdog adoŋo magi onwoŋo tye i kom: Eliacib, Joyada, Jokanan kede Jaddua. Coyo nyiŋ man obin ogik oko i kare me loc a Dario, abaka me Pacia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoŋe ame loo doggola a jo Levi rik ocoo nyiŋgi piny i buk adwoŋ me Tekwaro, kede naka i kare a Jokanan, ame obedo akwar Eliacib, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoŋe ame onwoŋo loo jo Levi ene: Kacabia, Cerebia, Yecua, kede Binnui, kede Kadmiel kede owotegi, gin onwoŋo obedo jo ame pako Obaŋa, kun oleo alea kite ame abaka Daudi, dano Obaŋa onwoŋo oyiko kede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aco Mattania, Bakbukia, Obadia, Mecullam, Talmon, kede Akkub onwoŋo obedo ogwok dogcel, kun ogwoko udi me kano jami ame onwoŋo tye i doggola me ot Obaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man obedo timere i kare a Joyakim wot a Yecua, akwar Yekojadak, kede i kare a Nekemia, ame obedo gabuna, kede dok i kare Ejira, alamdgo ame obedo apwonycik Obaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare me kwero apama cel me Jerucalem, okelo Olevi luŋ i kan ame gin onwoŋo obedo iye, gin luŋ okelogi i Jerucalem, me obin okwer kare man i yomcuny kede pwoc adwoŋ meicel baŋ Obaŋa, kun owero wer, ogoo naŋa, ajaa kede naŋa opuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Levi ame onwoŋo obedo ower luŋ te cokere i kabedo luŋ bino i Jerucalem, kun oya i kabedogi luŋ ame onwoŋo oguro Jerucalem, naka i pacci me Netopa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kede i Bet-gilgal, Geba, kede i Ajimavet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olamdog kede jo Levi koŋ ogeo lonyere pirgi kengi eka ote lonyo lwak, kede dogcel luŋ, kede apama cel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
