            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.26.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin obedo tiyo tic ame Obaŋa omiogi, kede tic me lonyo lwak bedo acil. Ower kede ogwok doggola ot Obaŋa daŋ obedo tiyo ticgi kite ame rik Daudi kede wode Culeman ociko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien i kare ame Daudi gin kede Acap, rik onwoŋo tye adwoŋ ame loo wer; i kare-naca onwoŋo ower wero wer me pako Obaŋa kede me pwoyo Obaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aco i kare a Jerubabel kede i kare a Nekemia, jo Icrael luŋ onwoŋo mio motgi nino ducu me konyo jo ame wero i ot Obaŋa kede me konyo jo ame gwoko doggola ot Obaŋa. Lwak daŋ obedo miyo motgi mogo pi jo Levi, jo Levi daŋ te bedo miyo en ame rik omito pi ikwae Aron, ame gin obedo olamdog.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
